<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings rise in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended Feb 8, roastings totaled approximately 425,000 60-kg bags, up from 400,000 bags the previous week and compared to 410,000 bags in the corresponding week a year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 2,290,000 60-kg bags, versus 2,220,000 bags in the same year ago period.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
